  "details": "An automatic update was applied two weeks ago on Wednesday (2024/12/04). Since then, my PC shuts down and restarts 5 minutes after launching VRChat, regardless of whether I’m using my PC or Quest 3.\n\nThis issue only occurs when VRChat is running. However, it doesn’t always happen upon launch. When the issue doesn’t occur, I can use VRChat alongside other software like OBS, Blender, Unity, and Adobe Substance Painter without any crashes. But when it does happen, the PC consistently shuts down 5 minutes after starting VRChat, even if I don’t move my avatar or change worlds.\n\nThis seems to be a critical bug, and I initially assumed it would be resolved quickly. However, it appears that I may be the only one facing this issue, so I decided to report it.\n\nI would appreciate your prompt attention to this matter. Thank you.",
